<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35170" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνδηλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>visible, manifest,
			clear</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνδηλα καὶ σαφῆ λέγειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					405
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. τι ποιεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					4.132
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>manifest, discovered, known</i>, mostly of persons, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				1277
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.36
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.41
				</span></i>
			: with a part., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνδηλοι ἔστε . . βαρυνόμενοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.64
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				88e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tht.</u>
				174d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				21.198
			</span></i>; of things, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί τὸ ὑποκείμενον, οὐκ ἔστιν
					ἔνδηλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>de An.</u>
					422b34
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-λως</span>: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ότατα, προλέγειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.139
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
